<h3>General information</h3>
<p>This site was created to raise awareness of the disastrous economic implications for the state of North Carolina created by HB2. If you have questions or comments, please don't hesitate to <a href="<%= url_for('contact') %>" class="link">get in touch</a>.</p>


<h3>Who?</h3>
<p>This site was created by <a href="http://tublitzed.com/?src=sb2" class="link" target="_blank">Rachel Tublitz</a>, with the help from a lot of friends, family, and fellow NC residents. A Durham resident who is strongly opposed to HB2, Rachel believes that it's valuable to try to tackle problems from multiple different angles. The bill is utterly outrageous on moral grounds, however she built this site to try and address the problem from the financial perspective. Check out our <a href="<%= url_for('resources')%>" class="link">resources section</a> for some examples of other great sites and projects out there who are also dedicated to stopping HB2.</p>


